<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-118.3-leakage-recovery-revenue-analytics-and-continuous-assurance" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3705" name="W3705. Leakage Detection, Quantification &amp; Root-Cause Analysis" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Exception alert (W3693); reconciliation variance (W3691/W3694); integrity anomaly
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: Exception queue across all channels
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / BI
Participants: Revenue Assurance Lead, BI (links to VS-28.1), Finance (links to VS-17.4), POS/IT (links to VS-08/VS-27), Channel owners (VS-10/VS-13/VS-54/VS-58/VS-80/VS-95), Loss Prevention (links to VS-23)
Source: workflow W3705 — Leakage Detection, Quantification &amp; Root-Cause Analysis</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3705_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3705_Lane1" name="Revenue Assurance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3705_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3705_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3705_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3705_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3705_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3705_Start3" name="Exception alert (W3693); reconciliation variance (W3691/W3694); integrity anomaly">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3705_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3705_Task4" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/BI triage and investigate exceptions from the integrity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Assurance Lead/BI triage and investigate exceptions from the integrity monitors (W3697–W3704): classify each by leakage vector (W3690), determine whether it represents genuine leakage, and prioritize by value/volume/risk
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / BI
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3705_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3705_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3705_Task5" name="Revenue Assurance Lead quantify confirmed leakage: estimate the revenue impact…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Lead quantify confirmed leakage: estimate the revenue impact (rate × volume × period), determine root cause (system defect, process gap, master-data error, human error, fraud), and assess the control failure (W3693)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / BI / Channel owner
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3705_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3705_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3705_Task6" name="Revenue Assurance Lead route the leakage: fraud/collusion to investigation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Revenue Assurance Lead route the leakage: fraud/collusion to investigation (W3708), recoverable to recovery (W3706), system/process root-cause to corrective action, and feed all to analytics (W3707) and the channel owner for fix
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3705_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3705_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3705_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3705_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-585 (ensure controlled execution — Leakage Recovery, Revenue Analytics &amp; Continuous Assurance (PA-118.3).) | - operational: continuous monitoring; operational: structured quantification method
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / BI</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3705_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3705_Annotation8" targetRef="W3705_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3705_Flow10" sourceRef="W3705_Start3" targetRef="W3705_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3705_Flow11" sourceRef="W3705_Task4" targetRef="W3705_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3705_Flow12" sourceRef="W3705_Task5" targetRef="W3705_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3705_Flow13" sourceRef="W3705_Task6" targetRef="W3705_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3705_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3705_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3705">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3705_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3705_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
