        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Assurance Lead/MDM assure pricing/promo master-data integrity: verify price master accuracy (SRP/trade/corporate/promo/bundle/quantity-break per profile §9.3), promo master setup, tax/VAT codes, and mandatory-discount configuration; detect data defects that cause leakage
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / MDM / Pricing
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3709_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3709_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
