        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Lead/IT govern pricing/promo system changes: control price-change and promo-setup through approval (links to W3695), test-before-deploy, and audit-trail; prevent unauthorized/manual price changes that cause leakage
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / IT / Pricing
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3709_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3709_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3709_Task6" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/MDM monitor master-data quality KPIs (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Revenue Assurance Lead/MDM monitor master-data quality KPIs (links to VS-28.2/W1177), drive remediation of data defects found via leakage root-cause (W3705), and report master-data integrity to MDM governance (links to VS-29) and program analytics (W3707)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / MDM / BI
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3709_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
