        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Assurance Lead/IT maintain the revenue-assurance technology stack: exception-monitoring and analytics platform, reconciliation tooling (e.g., BlackLine or custom per W348), POS-event streaming, and the leakage-detection models; ensure integration to POS/ecommerce/payment/GL systems
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / IT / BI
