        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Lead/BI develop and tune leakage-detection analytics/models: anomaly detection on pricing/override/promo/loyalty/refund/catch-weight/payment patterns, threshold rules, and ML-based detection where appropriate (links to VS-30.2); manage false-positive tuning
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / BI / Data Science
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
