Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / IT
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3710_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
