      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Multi-entity revenue; consolidated close; group reporting
Frequency: Monthly + on event
Volume: 5 legal entities
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Cross-Entity
Participants: Revenue Assurance Lead, Cross-Entity Shared Services (links to VS-72), Finance/Consolidation (links to VS-17.2), Digital Commerce entity (links to VS-10), Treasury (links to VS-18), Audit (links to VS-21.3)
Source: workflow W3711 — Multi-Entity Revenue Assurance &amp; Consolidated Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
