      <bpmn:userTask id="W3711_Task4" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Cross-Entity coordinate revenue assurance across the 5…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Assurance Lead/Cross-Entity coordinate revenue assurance across the 5 legal entities: confirm revenue is recognized by the correct entity (Depot Inc. recognizes ecommerce revenue at fulfillment per profile §2; Digital Commerce Inc. charges the fulfillment fee), reconcile intercompany revenue/fees (links to VS-72.2), and detect cross-entity leakage
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Cross-Entity / Finance
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3711_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3711_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3711_Task5" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Consolidation consolidate group revenue assurance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Lead/Consolidation consolidate group revenue assurance: ensure the consolidated revenue (links to VS-17.2) is complete and accurate across entities, intercompany revenue is eliminated, and group leakage is quantified and reported
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Finance / Consolidation
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3711_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3711_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3711_Task6" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Audit support group/external audit and consolidated…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Revenue Assurance Lead/Audit support group/external audit and consolidated revenue-reporting defense (links to VS-21/VS-22/VS-79), and report consolidated revenue-assurance posture to the audit committee (links to VS-21/VS-36) and governance (links to W3689)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Audit / Cross-Entity
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3711_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
