    <bpmn:process id="W_W3712" name="W3712. Revenue Assurance Maturity &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual program review; maturity assessment
Frequency: Annual + quarterly
Volume: Program maturity and improvement
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Finance
Participants: Revenue Assurance Lead, Finance (links to VS-17.4), Audit (links to VS-21.3), BI (links to VS-28.1), Channel owners, Governance (links to VS-36), Risk (links to VS-21.2)
Source: workflow W3712 — Revenue Assurance Maturity &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3712_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3712_Lane1" name="Revenue Assurance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3712_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3712_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3712_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3712_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3712_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3712_Start3" name="Annual program review; maturity assessment">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3712_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3712_Task4" name="Revenue Assurance Lead assess program maturity against a revenue-assurance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Assurance Lead assess program maturity against a revenue-assurance maturity model (reactive audit → periodic controls → continuous monitoring → predictive/preventive), identify gaps, and set the maturity-improvement roadmap
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Audit
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3712_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3712_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3712_Task5" name="Revenue Assurance Lead drive continuous improvement: implement monitoring for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Lead drive continuous improvement: implement monitoring for newly-mapped leakage vectors (W3690), expand channel coverage, advance analytics/automation (W3710), and mature from detective to preventive controls
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Finance / BI
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3712_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3712_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3712_Task6" name="Revenue Assurance Lead report program maturity, leakage-reduction progress…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Revenue Assurance Lead report program maturity, leakage-reduction progress against target, and residual revenue-leakage exposure to governance (links to W3689/VS-36), the executive risk committee (links to VS-21.2), and the board (links to VS-36)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3712_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3712_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3712_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3712_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-585 (ensure controlled execution — Leakage Recovery, Revenue Analytics &amp; Continuous Assurance (PA-118.3).) | - operational: maturity roadmap; operational: continuous-improvement and preventive focus
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
